{\"color\":\"default\",\"parent\":[]}","children":[]},{"blockId":"211a501e-f337-8127-876d-e8b922a06c1c","type":"paragraph","parent":"{\"color\":\"default\",\"parent\":[{\"annotations\":{\"bold\":true,\"italic\":false,\"strikethrough\":false,\"underline\":false,\"code\":false,\"color\":\"default\"},\"plain_text\":\"macの場合\",\"href\":null}]}","children":[]},{"blockId":"211a501e-f337-81d7-a0fe-d9486fbc829f","type":"bookmark","parent":"{\"parent\":[],\"url\":\"https://matsuand.github.io/docs.docker.jp.onthefly/desktop/mac/install/\",\"downloadUrl\":\"/horizon-atlas/notion_data/eachPage/211a501e-f337-8033-aba3-e2b9e036eacf/ogsData/211a501e-f337-81d7-a0fe-d9486fbc829f.json\"}","children":[]},{"blockId":"211a501e-f337-81b0-a839-d3728e439d02","type":"paragraph","parent":"{\"color\":\"default\",\"parent\":[]}","children":[]},{"blockId":"211a501e-f337-812a-92b9-f47081f7c205","type":"toggle","parent":"{\"color\":\"default\",\"parent\":[{\"annotations\":{\"bold\":true,\"italic\":false,\"strikethrough\":false,\"underline\":false,\"code\":false,\"color\":\"default\"},\"plain_text\":\"Linux（Ubuntu）の場合はDocker Engine（cli）をインストールします\",\"href\":null}]}","children":[{"blockId":"211a501e-f337-81cf-90ae-e93a7b98133f","type":"paragraph","parent":"{\"color\":\"default\",\"parent\":[{\"annotations\":{\"bold\":false,\"italic\":false,\"strikethrough\":false,\"underline\":false,\"code\":false,\"color\":\"default\"},\"plain_text\":\"一つずつ実行してください\",\"href\":null}]}","children":[]},{"blockId":"211a501e-f337-81ac-bd8e-d696f48cd810","type":"code","parent":"```shell\n# 1. 既存のDockerがあれば削除\nsudo apt remove docker docker-engine docker.io containerd runc\n\n# 2. 必要なパッケージをインストール\nsudo apt update\nsudo apt install -y ca-certificates curl gnupg\n\n# 3. Dockerの公式GPGキー追加\nsudo install -m 0755 -d /etc/apt/keyrings\ncurl -fsSL https://download.docker.com/linux/ubuntu/gpg | \\\n  sudo gpg --dearmor -o /etc/apt/keyrings/docker.gpg\n\n# 4. リポジトリ追加\necho \\\n  \"deb [arch=$(dpkg --print-architecture) \\\n  signed-by=/etc/apt/keyrings/docker.gpg] \\\n  https://download.docker.com/linux/ubuntu \\\n  $(lsb_release -cs) stable\" | \\\n  sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/docker.list > /dev/null\n\n# 5. Docker本体のインストール\nsudo apt update\nsudo apt install -y docker-ce docker-ce-cli containerd.io docker-buildx-plugin docker-compose-plugin\n\n# 6. dockerコマンドが動くか確認\nsudo docker run hello-world\n\n```","children":[]},{"blockId":"211a501e-f337-81c7-aa6e-d0ea7337cfff","type":"paragraph","parent":"{\"color\":\"default\",\"parent\":[{\"annotations\":{\"bold\":false,\"italic\":false,\"strikethrough\":false,\"underline\":false,\"code\":false,\"color\":\"default\"},\"plain_text\":\"sudoなしで使いたい場合：\",\"href\":null}]}","children":[]},{"blockId":"211a501e-f337-81b2-95a4-cb987a25b8cb","type":"code","parent":"```shell\nsudo usermod -aG docker $USER\nnewgrp docker\n```","children":[]}]},{"blockId":"211a501e-f337-81e8-8bb7-d22baea2b7e2","type":"heading_2","parent":"{\"parent\":[{\"annotations\":{\"bold\":false,\"italic\":false,\"strikethrough\":false,\"underline\":false,\"code\":false,\"color\":\"default\"},\"plain_text\":\"インストールが完了したら\",\"href\":null}],\"color\":\"default\",\"is_toggleable\":false}","children":[]},{"blockId":"211a501e-f337-8111-8cb9-e26e58e0394e","type":"divider","parent":"---","children":[]},{"blockId":"211a501e-f337-8106-9819-e7b1f0366424","type":"paragraph","parent":"{\"color\":\"default\",\"parent\":[{\"annotations\":{\"bold\":false,\"italic\":false,\"strikethrough\":false,\"underline\":false,\"code\":false,\"color\":\"default\"},\"plain_text\":\"インストールが完了したら以下のコマンドを実行できるか確認してください\",\"href\":null}]}","children":[]},{"blockId":"211a501e-f337-81c7-b0f7-e4a9f701b9cb","type":"code","parent":"```shell\ndocker --version\ndocker run hello-world\n```","children":[]},{"blockId":"211a501e-f337-8153-ad95-c7340aa5f1d8","type":"paragraph","parent":"{\"color\":\"default\",\"parent\":[{\"annotations\":{\"bold\":false,\"italic\":false,\"strikethrough\":false,\"underline\":false,\"code\":false,\"color\":\"default\"},\"plain_text\":\"次→\",\"href\":null},{\"annotations\":{\"bold\":false,\"italic\":false,\"strikethrough\":false,\"underline\":false,\"code\":false,\"color\":\"default\"},\"plain_text\":\"Dockerとは？\",\"href\":\"/posts/curriculums/211a501e-f337-8033-aba3-e2b9e036eacf/211a501e-f337-8195-81b6-ebbc6999f155\"}]}","children":[]}],"pageNavs":[{"title":"Home","link":"/posts"},{"title":"技術ガイド","link":"/posts/course/技術ガイド"},{"title":"Dockerガイド","link":"/posts/curriculums/211a501e-f337-8033-aba3-e2b9e036eacf/211a501e-f337-8033-aba3-e2b9e036eacf"},{"link":"/posts/curriculums/211a501e-f337-8033-aba3-e2b9e036eacf/211a501e-f337-81b4-9b29-f9f99f64ba24","title":" Dockerのインストール"}],"childrenData":{"title":"Dockerガイド","childPages":[{"title":" Dockerのインストール","id":"211a501e-f337-81b4-9b29-f9f99f64ba24"},{"title":" Dockerとは？","id":"211a501e-f337-8195-81b6-ebbc6999f155"},{"title":" コンテナ起動までの流れ","id":"211a501e-f337-8114-98e2-c56b90c48d3f"},{"title":" イメージとコンテナについて","id":"211a501e-f337-816b-83ce-c443681b6751"}]},"pageId":"211a501e-f337-81b4-9b29-f9f99f64ba24","iconInfo":[],"iconUrl":"https://www.notion.so/icons/arrow-down-line_blue.svg","iconType":"external","coverUrl":"","firstText":"windowsかmacの場合は以下のサイトを見てDocker Desktopをインストールしてください"},"__N_SSG":true}